        "method": "primary-fetch",
        "note": "Read on 14 November 2026. Version 1.6.0 is dated 31 August 2026 and was still current; its files were fetched twice that day and did not change. The matrix file (https://d3fend.mitre.org/api/matrix.json) holds seven tactics and 272 techniques nested up to five deep; 271 carry an identifier, and one, Particle Radiation Hardening, has none in this release. The matrix is listed in the order the site shows it, by name at each level. Release 1.6.0 tracks ATT&CK v19.0, not v20. Read again on 15 November 2026: 1.6.0 of 31 August 2026 is still current, the matrix still holds seven tactics and 272 techniques, and the ontology still names ATT&CK v19.0.",
        "recheckAfter": "2027-01-15"
      }
